- command interrupted
- API key missing
- model timeout
- invalid model output
- Builder timeout
- oversized diff
- binary-only changes
- excluded sensitive file changes
- report storage failure
- malformed config

Verik must give a useful message and preserve as much evidence as possible.

If no changes were produced:

