25. DEFINITION OF DONE
==================================================

The initial Verik release is done when this works:

1. Start in a fixture repository.
2. Run:

       verik run -- node modify-repository.js

3. The child command runs normally.
4. Verik correctly identifies only the changes introduced by that command.
5. Scout returns valid structured scope/risk.
6. Builder detects and executes relevant safe project checks.
7. Deterministic rules produce evidence.
8. Reviewer returns evidence-linked findings.
9. Judge produces a supported verdict.
10. Policy engine returns the proper decision and exit code.
11. Terminal output is useful.
